&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to senior security leadership (e.g., CISO, SOC leadership) and other executive stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong consultative selling skills, with the ability to uncover customer needs and build compelling, ROI-driven business cases&lt;/li&gt;
