&lt;li&gt;Experience developing AI products that leverage natural language processing, computer vision, or other machine learning techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPENSATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is $180,000–$240,000. Final compensation will depend on experience, skills, and location. This role is also eligible for our bonus program and equity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT ANDESITE CAN OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid comprehensive medical, dental, and vision insurance for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 14 weeks of 100% paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous, flexible PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A true remote-first culture, where you manage your own workday&lt;/li&gt;
